## 0 · WHAT THIS FILE IS

⬜ **One sentence: what does this discipline decide?**

> ## ⬜ The criterion that decides whether {{DISCIPLINE}} work is …

⭐ **Say what it decides, not what it is about.** *"About testing"* names a topic; *"decides
whether something is proven to work"* names a judgement — ⛔ **and only the second can reject
anything.**

### ⬜ Why this discipline exists — the failure it prevents

⚠️ **Name the failure, not the subject.** ⭐ A discipline with no failure behind it is a topic
someone found interesting, and it will not survive its first inconvenient verdict.

⬜ **Write it here, and keep it general** — the shape of the failure, never a case that only makes
sense to whoever lived it.

