## ⭐ BEFORE YOU SHIP IT — the checks the seven had to pass

| # | Check | ⛔ If it fails |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | **no `⬜` left as a BLANK** | ⭐ a blank that shipped is a criterion nobody wrote |
| 2 | **every criterion has a `Verify`** | ⛔ a criterion with no observation is an opinion with an ID |
| 3 | ⭐ **your prefix collides with none of the seven** | two criteria at one address |
| 4 | **no rule restated that another file owns** | ⚠️ cite it instead — see §2 |
| 5 | ⭐ **at least one citation into another discipline** | ⛔ a file citing nobody is not part of a system |
| 6 | **the header carries all five fields** | it fails its own document contract |
| 7 | ⭐ **§0 names a failure, not a topic** | ⛔ it will not survive its first inconvenient verdict |
| 8 | **declared in the piece table** (`../../../pieces.tsv`) | ⭐ undeclared is invisible to every check |

> ## ⚠️ `⬜` HAS TWO USES — check 1 only covers the first
> | Use | Example | Check 1 |
> |---|---|---|
> | ⭐ **a BLANK you must fill** | `⬜ …` in a table cell | ⛔ **must not ship** |
> | **a legitimate STATE** | ⬜ `UNKNOWN` · ⬜ `NOT_MEASURED` · ⬜ `pending` | ✅ ships |
>
> ⭐ **A search for the glyph alone cannot tell them apart** — read what it marks. ⚠️ **Anything
> that counts markers automatically will count both**, and report a filled file as unfinished.

⭐ **Check 5 is the one that is easiest to skip and hardest to add later.** A discipline written in
isolation duplicates what its neighbours already decided — ⚠️ **and the duplication is only found
when the two copies have already diverged.**

